      ":question/problem": "![](images/6c/6c47b504526c14c8c5698291344d4788a62f3a545628d9d3fd0903987852373d.png)\n\nA person $P$ is standing on a bridge $120ft$ above a river. A boat $B$ is sailing on the river away from the bridge at a constant velocity of $32ft/s$. Find, in radians per second as a function of $\u03b8$, the rate at which the angle of elevation $\u03b8$ between the boat and the person is decreasing.\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
